# `eth` CLI environment variables (Issue #341)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` in the directory where you invoke `eth` and
# customise. `.env` itself is git-ignored.
#
# Precedence: explicit `--flag` > env var > `.env` file > centralised
# default. See `docs/plans/2026-08-25-001-feat-eth-cli-env-config-plan.md`
# for the resolution table.

# RPC endpoint. Single centralised default (`http://127.0.0.1:8545`) lives
# on the global `Cli.rpc_url` clap arg in main.rs and applies when no flag
# or env override is set. Override for Sepolia/Mainnet smoke:
#   ETH_RPC_URL=https://sepolia.infura.io/v3/YOUR_KEY_HERE
#ETH_RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545

# Logical network: mainnet | sepolia | anvil. Numeric chain_id aliases
# (`1`, `11155111`, `31337`) also accepted. Required when `--network`
# flag is omitted — falls back to `default_value = "sepolia"` in clap.
#ETH_NETWORK=sepolia

# Wallet store base directory. Default: XDG data dir.
#ETH_DATA_DIR=/path/to/eth-data

# Password used by `wallet create` / `wallet import` / `wallet send-*`
# when `--password` flag is omitted. Recommended over argv passing
# (shell history + process-list safety). Already wired in handlers.rs.
#ETH_PASSWORD=replace-me-with-real-password
